# 4. 🗄 database/

Not your Django models.

This is database administration.

```
database/

backups/

daily.sql

weekly.sql

monthly.sql

seeds/

sample companies

sample users

demo data

migrations/

custom sql

performance scripts
```

If a customer loses data,

you restore it from

```
database/backups/
```

