# 5. 🤖 ai-services/

This is the folder I think will become your biggest competitive advantage.

Instead of putting AI inside Django,

you create separate microservices.

---

## assistant/

Think of this as ChatGPT for construction.

Eventually users can ask

> How much cement has Project A used?

> Which suppliers delayed delivery?

> Which workers are absent today?

> Generate a weekly report.

> Explain why Project B is behind schedule.

The assistant queries your ERP and returns answers.

---

Example

```
assistant/

chat.py

llm.py

memory.py

prompts.py

tools.py
```

---

## document_reader/

Construction companies upload

- PDFs

- Drawings

- Contracts

- BOQs

- Specifications

Instead of opening 200-page documents,

the AI reads them.

Example

User asks

> What is the concrete strength required for the foundation?

AI searches the uploaded specification.

Returns

> Section 5.2 requires C30 concrete.

Another example

> When does this contract expire?

AI reads the contract.

---

Example

```
document_reader/

pdf_reader.py

ocr.py

embeddings.py

indexer.py
```

---

